      "published": "2026-09-17T10:44:49Z",
      "score": 124,
      "comments": 36,
      "hn_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49738879",
      "snippet": "I was looking at neovim&#x27;s donation footer at the bottom of their site and saw a bitcoin donation address.<p>Thought I&#x27;d check how much in donations they&#x27;ve gotten. And I saw this massive 10 Bitcoin donation from back in 2023 (worth $800,000 now...)<p>From the activity history, neovim last sent bitcoin out of the address in 2019 so it&#x27;s been max 7 years since they&#x27;ve definitely had access.<p>Does anyone from the neovim project know about this? \nSeems like a pretty significant amount of funding to have sitting there. Hope it can come to good use as I use neovim daily.<p>https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.blockchain.com&#x2F;explorer&#x2F;addresses&#x2F;btc&#x2F;1Evu6wPrzjsjrNPdCYbHy3HT6ry2EzXFyQ",
      "links": []
